  "description": "Suhyeon finds himself homeless after falling victim to a jeonse scam. With nowhere else to go, he ends up living under the same roof as his former homeroom teacher—the strict, intimidating woman he once feared during his school days.  Living together reveals a completely different side of her, one filled with unexpected secrets and a much more intimate dynamic than he ever imagined. As the boundaries between teacher and former student blur, their cohabitation takes a steamy and complicated turn.\n\n\n\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://toptoon.com/comic/ep_list/live_with_teacher)",
